# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` uploads as the build context. Without this file gcloud
# GENERATES one from .gitignore — which excludes the console's two build artifacts
# (web/app.js, web/tokens.css) that the committed web/index.html references and the image
# COPYs. That shipped a blank-white /console (runbook 0005, wall 6). Inherit git's ignores,
# then re-include exactly those two (negations must come after the include to win).
.git
.gitignore
#!include:.gitignore
!web/app.js
!web/tokens.css
